rly a century.\n\n### Course Updates:\n- Bellerive - Adjusted the rough that was encroaching on the 9th Green.\n- Caves Valley - Tee markers now show BMW logo on all sides.\n- Kiawah - Corrected the green flags to show the course logo.\n- Updated elevations values for Atolls & Save Muny.\n- Adjusted some terrain levels of details for Q2 on Omni La Costa & Save Muny.\n", "created_date": 1790027923, "id": "28236311156037596", "version": "815.02", "version_code": 150551, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 34}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2412327085529357", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28236263066042405"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2309851355956647"}]}, "change_log": "## Update v815.02 is Live!\n\n## New Course: Medinah Country Club No. 3\nLocated just 25 miles west of Chicago, Medinah Country Club is home to three iconic courses, highlighted by the legendary Course No. 3. \nOriginally designed by Tom Bendelow, it has played host to multiple Major Championships over the years, and this year will serve as the host of the 2026 Presidents Cup. \nSet across 600 acres of rolling oak forest and defined by its distinctive red-brick clubhouse, Medinah has earned worldwide acclaim and attracted golf's greatest legends for nearly a century.\n\n### Course Updates:\n- Bellerive - Adjusted the rough that was encroaching on the 9th Green.\n- Caves Valley - Tee markers now show BMW logo on all sides.\n- Kiawah - Corrected the green flags to show the course logo.\n- Updated elevations values for Atolls & Save Muny.\n- Adjusted some terrain levels of details for Q2 on Omni La Costa & Save Muny.\n", "created_date": 1790027626, "id": "28236263066042405", "version": "815.02", "version_code": 150549, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 35}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2412327085529357", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28236263066042405"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1790023060, "id": "28235537649448280", "version": "815.02", "version_code": 150548, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 34}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2412327085529357", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28236263066042405"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1790022732, "id": "28235479879454057", "version": "815.02", "version_code": 150546, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 35}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2412327085529357", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28236263066042405"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2309851355956647"}]}, "change_log": "## Patch v814.2\n\n### Quality:\n- Addressed reports of loss of club selection on the Club Bar UI.\n\n### Upcoming Drops:\nRepresent the teams of the Presidents Cup in time for tee off, **dropping today**!\n- 2 Drivers\n- 2 Iron Sets\n- 2 Mallet Putters\n- 2 Bags\n- 2 Golf Balls\n\nBring the Old Game, vintage leather, and wood finish to your bag coming 10/1!\n- 1 Driver\n- 1 Fairway Wood\n- 1 Golf Bag\n- 1 Golf Ball\n- 1 Shaft\n- 1 Grip\n\nGrand Prix Driver, and matching racing headcover set, ready for the big race coming 10/8!\n- 1 Driver\n- 1 Driver Headcover\n- 1 Wood Headcover\n", "created_date": 1789759678, "id": "28196164320052280", "version": "814.2", "version_code": 150539, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 34}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}